<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A2.T11.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 11</span>: </span><span id="A2.T11.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="A2.T11.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Medical Datasets Safety-net Filtering.</span> This table shows student accuracy when using Safety-Net filtering with <math id="A2.T11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=-0.2,0.5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.2</mn></mrow></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=-0.2,0.5</annotation></semantics></math> across different filtering keep ratios, with ImageNet-21K and ImageNet-1K as reference sets.
</span></figcaption>
<table id="A2.T11.6" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
